{"id": 102, "name": "Mathilda", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/9/92/Hero1021-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021143131", "cls": ["Support", "Assassin"], "specialty": ["Initiator", "Guard"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["80", "20", "40", "40"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "A brave girl who stands up and doesn't fear power.", "skills": [{"name": "Ancestral Guidance", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f201e693e1129614b1b22047e28a4c2c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Mathilda gains <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ancestral Guidance</span> while moving. When it's fully charged, her next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the target and granting her 80 extra Movement Speed that decays over 2.5s."}, {"name": "Soul Bloom", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4b41810acba280a3b6e9bba321bfbb74.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7.5   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Mathilda resonates with the power of her ancestors for 4s, attracting wisps as her movement distance increases (up to 6 wisps).\n\nAt the end of the skill's duration, or when Mathilda casts this skill again, the wisps will seek and attack nearby enemies, each dealing 275<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+80% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and revealing the enemies' positions briefly. Subsequent damage dealt by wisps to the same target decays to 40%."}, {"name": "Guiding Wind", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9c364f42f896209e76c50e9460a9395e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "CD: 13.5   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Mathilda leaps in the target direction and creates a field around her, gaining a 350<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+180% Total Magic Power)</span> shield and 25% extra Movement Speed for 3s. Allied heroes who come into contact with the field will receive a 50% shield and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Guiding Wind</span>. The first allied hero that triggers <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Guiding Wind</span> will be guided to Mathilda, and both of them will gain the same Movement Speed boost.\n\nWhen casting this skill during <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Circling Eagle</span>, Mathilda won't change her position.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Guiding Wind</span> expires 2s after the hero leaves Mathilda's field."}, {"name": "Circling Eagle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9dade03c4d55cf327e9f1cb279e99f29.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "CD: 65   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Mathilda applies a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Mark</span> to the target enemy hero and circles around them for up to 3.5s, during which her wisps will fly into nearby enemies, each dealing 40<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+15% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. The Soul Mark will also slow the target by 15% and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Bloom</span> will prioritize the target with Soul Mark.\nWithin the duration, Mathilda can select an area to dash to. At the end of the duration, she'll dash at the target with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Mark</span>, dealing 320<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+120% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> while knocking enemies in her path airborne for 0.6s, transferring the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Mark</span> to the first enemy hero that she knocks airborne, and reducing the skill cooldown by 40%.\nMathilda gains Control Immunity and a 400<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+160% Total Magic Power)</span> shield for the skill duration."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Favor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_12cd58877c425abbd4bbcc5003c6d032.png"}, {"name": "Flask of the Oasis", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bd4250e426ca1cf5e7f8a7b0861ad4b1.png"}, {"name": "Enchanted Talisman", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6f55284f79c40b01eec5b151ff791094.png"}, {"name": "Oracle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bc24b55abbbec6da408eb0ea5c37cad4.png"}, {"name": "Athena's Shield", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d9bb48a8df64ae5065d370adca6a5153.png"}, {"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Support", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3bd7417bce76995285722e25d8ff5ebd.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Agility", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3bd6911932aacab006e9ab2d7fd452bc.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Wilderness Blessing", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4f6b378bdf1f7d9802387f44f37d7f04.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Quantum Charge", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_53e9b9d5ef3f61800a29a8aa8d299931.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}}, {"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Favor", "icon": "http